gy and intensity throughout the whole game. Despite the scores, they have been cheering and constantly high-fiving us be it during highs or lows."},{"game_id":160,"givenby":"Colombia Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"Their communication was very good, they were always willing to receive, listen and were really polite on explaining their perspective. \r\nThere was a lot of contact, specially when handlers tried to go for the crash. There were many foul calls on the disc mark and this was not corrected after the feedback. \r\nSome Defense bids were late ending up on bumping or collisions. \r\nGreat and windy game! \r\n"},{"game_id":158,"givenby":"Hong Kong, China Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":"Thank you for the game! Barely any calls and very spirited game.\r\n\r\nPositive attitude: thank you for being encouraging after each point! All the best for the rest of the tourney!"},{"game_id":220,"givenby":"Great Britain Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":226,"givenby":"Argentina Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":230,"givenby":"Austria Mixed","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":4,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"They played with appropriate intensity irrespective of the score. At times where our team was frustrated they cheered for us and brought out the best in us.\r\nThey congratulated us on every great play and actively came up to us for high fives and nice little chats!"}],"spiritstats":{"games":10},"spirittotal":{"total":106}}